2.4 Behaviour
Auth: access token kept in memory (Zustand), never in localStorage. On app load call /auth/refresh silently, then /auth/me. Axios interceptor: on 401, refresh once (queue parallel requests), retry, else log out.
Permissions: useCan(perm) reads the permission map from /auth/me. RequirePermission redirects to a friendly /403 page. Sidebar items, buttons, table actions, and form fields are hidden or disabled by can(). The frontend never hard-codes the role matrix.
State: TanStack Query for server data (keys like ['assets', filters], ['asset', id], ['dashboard']), Zustand only for auth and UI. Filters and pagination live in URL search params.
Every screen has loading (skeleton), empty (with a clear next action), and error (what happened and a retry) states.
