2.6 Offline (implement a simple version)

Detect offline with useOnline. If offline while creating an asset, inspection, or report, store the request in IndexedDB (use the small idb-keyval package or raw IndexedDB) with an Idempotency-Key; show a "Waiting to sync (n)" chip in the header; flush the queue on reconnect and toast "Synced n items". Skip service worker and precaching unless time remains.

